Sharks exist, but they rarely attack humans. Most sharks are afraid of humans and swim away quickly.
Saltwater mussels are rarely found in the ocean; their primary habitat is the river mouths located north of Rockhampton.
Booking in advance ensures a place to stay upon arrival, providing peace of mind for the traveler.
Although you can order other types of accommodation, such as camping, through a travel agency, travel agencies often have agreements with specific hotels.
Travel agents typically offer packages that include breakfast, airport transfer, or even flights and hotel accommodations.
If you need additional documents (such as a visa) for your destination and require time to provide or obtain them, they may also arrange them for you.
All changes and requests must be submitted not directly to the hotels, but through a travel agency first.
