There are various methods of water purification, some of which are quite effective against certain hazards.
In some areas, one minute is sufficient for water to boil, while in others, several minutes are required.
Filters vary in effectiveness; if you're concerned, you should consider buying bottled water from a reputable company.
Travelers may encounter unknown animal parasites in their regions.
Pests can damage food products, cause spoilage, or even lead to more serious issues such as allergic reactions, poisoning, or infection.
